# The released Tokvera and Sievant artifacts a Halotrcer release bundles:
# the image copies their binaries out of these images, and the umbrella chart
# packages these charts. Each is pinned by digest and cosign-verified against
# its own release workflow's identity before use (.github/workflows/release.yml).
# The versions must be inside internal/compat/matrix.json
# (TestBundledToolsInMatrix). Strict KEY=value lines, read by
# scripts/release/bundled-tools.sh, never sourced.
#
# Empty until both tools publish v0.2.0 (PLAN.md C1): the release preflight
# refuses to run before every value is set. Read the digests with
#   docker buildx imagetools inspect ghcr.io/rajasatyajit/tokvera:vX.Y.Z
#   oras resolve ghcr.io/rajasatyajit/charts/tokvera:X.Y.Z
# (and the same for sievant), and check each tool's release notes.
TOKVERA_VERSION=
TOKVERA_IMAGE_DIGEST=
TOKVERA_CHART_DIGEST=
SIEVANT_VERSION=
SIEVANT_IMAGE_DIGEST=
SIEVANT_CHART_DIGEST=
